        {
            "source": "ARDSNet PEEP/FiO2 Tables (2000)",
            "guidance": "Higher PEEP strategy for FiO2 0.8: PEEP 14 cmH2O recommended. Higher PEEP (vs lower PEEP) reduces mortality in moderate-severe ARDS (PaO2/FiO2 <200 mmHg) but not mild ARDS",
